...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

assessment_agent: Assessment 에이전트 { class: ours }
action_agent: Action 에이전트 { class: ours }
gpt4o: GPT-4o { class: ext }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }

assessment_agent -> action_agent: SwarmResult(action_agent)
action_agent -> gpt4o: 요약 강제 프롬프트 + 누적 요약
gpt4o -> action_agent: update_action_overview 호출
action_agent -> ui: 사이드바 표시
